sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant MobileApp as "Mobile App"
    participant Backend as "Backend API"
    participant RetailerAPI as "Retailer API"
    participant AggregatorAPI as "Aggregator API"
    participant PlacesAPI as "Google Places API"
    participant Scraper as "Web Scraper"
    participant Geocoder as "Geocoding Service"

    User->>MobileApp: Adds product to Reminder List
    MobileApp->>Backend: POST /api/reminders (Reminder List)
    alt Retailer API available
        Backend->>RetailerAPI: Query for product/store
        RetailerAPI-->>Backend: Return store addresses
    else Aggregator API available
        Backend->>AggregatorAPI: Query for product/store
        AggregatorAPI-->>Backend: Return store addresses
    else Google Places API available
        Backend->>PlacesAPI: Query for store type/location
        PlacesAPI-->>Backend: Return store addresses
    else Fallback to Web Scraping
        Backend->>Scraper: Search for stores
        Scraper-->>Backend: Return store addresses
    end
    Backend->>Geocoder: Geocode addresses (if needed)
    Geocoder-->>Backend: Return lat/lon
    Backend-->>MobileApp: Return store coordinates
    MobileApp->>MobileApp: Register geofences for stores
    User->>MobileApp: Moves near a store
    MobileApp->>MobileApp: Detects geofence entry
    MobileApp-->>User: Sends push notification ("You are near a store with your item!")